@.str.5 = private unnamed_addr constant [345 x i8] c"Z3 represents algebraic numbers using a (square-free) polynomial p and an isolating interval (which contains one and only one root of p). This interval may be refined during the computations. This parameter specifies whether to cache the value of a refined interval or not. It says the minimal size of an interval for caching purposes is 1/2^16\00", align 1
